T Ladder beam
# The long span of the system, from the K'NEX User Group's own hint: two rails of connectors, rods
# along each rail, and a zigzag of shorter rods between them. Far stiffer than one long rod.
! two rails 1U apart with a white zigzag between them
C L0 W8 0,0,0
C L1 W8 2,0,0
C L2 W8 4,0,0
C U0 W8 1,1,0
C U1 W8 3,1,0
R L0 L1
R L1 L2
R U0 U1
R L0 U0
R U0 L1
R L1 U1
R U1 L2
